{"id":"c2ddd4406d7beea4","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-generic-embedding-properties.md","title":"Generic Embedding Properties","display":"thm-generic-embedding-properties — Generic Embedding Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-generic-embedding-properties","aliases":["58-thm-generic-embedding-properties","Generic Embedding Properties","Forcing Embeddings"],"display":"thm-generic-embedding-properties — Generic Embedding Properties","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-generic-embedding-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-generic-embedding-properties</span><span>Generic Embedding Properties</span><span>Forcing Embeddings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-embedding-properties — Generic Embedding Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc.md\">58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"327fc5339902933e\" href=\"?note=327fc5339902933e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md\">../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,j,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,j,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\in V\\)</span> 是两个集合编码模型、候选嵌入与 ZF 理论码</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a> 中固定的纯成员语言及其真实成员结构谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 是集合编码结构的载集算子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> 是传递集合谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\)</span>（只接受集合结构，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\)</span> 是临界点谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"327fc5339902933e\" href=\"?note=327fc5339902933e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md\">../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(T_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> 是 <code>58-ax-zfc</code> 的纯成员语言理论码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}properties}\\vdash{}&amp;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\land j\\neq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\}\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\land\\kappa\\in j(\\kappa)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}properties}\\vdash{}&amp;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\land j\\neq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\}\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\land\\kappa\\in j(\\kappa)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该断言只形式化当前知识库能够表达的集合编码核心：非平凡初等嵌入在传递 ZF 模型间具有最小被移动序数。</li>\n<li>真正的 generic embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\\subseteq V[G]\">\\(j:V\\to M\\subseteq V[G]\\)</span> 涉及真类，不能传给集合三元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span>；它需要另建类理论接口。</li>\n<li>Precipitous 理想保证相应泛型超幂良基；没有良基性就不能把商结构视为传递类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Saturation: stronger, gives closure.</li>\n<li>Precipitous and saturated ideals yield generic ultrapowers with stronger closure.</li>\n<li>Reflection phenomena in the ground model are extracted from the target model of the embedding.</li>\n<li>Applications: forcing axioms, reflection.</li>\n<li>Stationary tower: produces generic embeddings.</li>\n<li>Connection: large cardinals, ideals.</li>\n<li>传递性现在调用真实的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> 签名；两个结构的成员关系也在断言中显式固定为外部真实的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>，不再只留在自然语言前提里。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"327fc5339902933e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\in}$ 与 $\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)$ 是 [[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]] 中固定的纯成员语言及其真实成员结构谓词","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})$ 与 $\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})$（see [[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S$ 是传递集合谓词（see [[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)$（只接受集合结构，see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"327fc5339902933e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)$ 是临界点谓词（see [[../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,j,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathcal L_{\\in})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kap